msgid ""
"Meta app secret, used to verify the X-Hub-Signature-256 header on incoming "
"webhook calls. Without it Horilla cannot tell a real delivery from a forged "
"one, so unsigned payloads are rejected. Find it under App Settings > Basic "
"in the Meta developer console."
msgstr ""
"Meta 應用程式密鑰，用於驗證傳入 Webhook 呼叫的 X-Hub-Signature-256 標頭。若無"
"此密鑰，Horilla 無法分辨傳送內容是否遭偽造，因此未簽署的資料將被拒絕。可於 "
"Meta 開發者主控台的「應用程式設定 > 基本」中找到。"

